# VERBATIM data block data_co_mg82 from CCDC deposition 1458682 (CCDC Access Structures, downloaded by the user), cited in 10.1002/chem.202100626 CCDC 1458682
# MeOH-free [DyIII{NiII(L)}2]ClO4 crystal (moiety C66H84DyN6Ni2O12, ClO4, no MeOH; the MeOH solvate is 1458681). Paper: fragment calculations 'on the crystal structural coordinates' of the MeOH-free structure with neighbouring centres substituted by diamagnetic analogues (Dy site, both Ni->Zn); the CIF is the unsubstituted crystal. One CIF shared by rows -a, -b, -c (three sites of one molecule).; crystal formula C66 H84 Cl Dy N6 Ni2 O16. Experimental (X-ray) structure, not optimised.
